  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e3cf711bd06ef4f479a2906fc1414ca9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Vieja13_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.Dialogues.DialoguesData
  language: 1
  dialogues:
  - <sketchy>We meet once again, Guardian of the Order.\nThis is the end of your
    journey.</sketchy>
  - I am one ingredient away from completing my spell. Where is it? You would ask...
    <sketchy>I find myself talking to it at this very moment.</sketchy>
  - Only the soul of a true warrior will allow me to wander freely, with no need
    of this <sketchy>old</sketchy> and <sketchy>useless</sketchy> vessel.
  - 'The only vessel that remained after that last battle where I tested the warriors
    limits, tried to unlock their maximum potential... Only to watch them <dangle>die</dangle>
    one by one. '
  - Finally, someone worthy appears. Someone who can give me the freedom I so long
    desired.
  - You have no idea how much I waited for this moment...
  - Now... <shake>GIVE ME YOUR SOUL!</shake>
